# Allow-list: `COPY . /suite` (Dockerfile) takes only what the suite runs.
# Anything else at the root (a stray .npmrc, id_rsa, notes) stays out.
*
!harness
!fakes
!tests
!pytest.ini
# run.sh only for tests/test_run_sh_host_check.py, which runs it with a fake docker.
!run.sh
# After the allow lines, so a listed secret or cache pattern inside an
# allowed folder is still excluded.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.pem
**/.netrc
